@startuml
title TITLE

[*] --> Idle

state Idle
state Connecting
state Connected {
  [*] --> Authenticating
  Authenticating --> Ready : keys exchanged
  Ready --> Authenticating : re-key
}
state Error

Idle        --> Connecting : connect requested
Connecting  --> Connected  : link established
Connecting  --> Error      : timeout
Connected   --> Idle       : disconnect
Error       --> Idle       : reset

Error : entry / log the cause
Error : exit  / clear the flag

@enduml
